From 1a6cc9ceaf9b1d4cd0c8452b1470470acd4f88e4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mcsm <mcsm@localhost>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 16:24:11 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 24/25] impeller (mcsm10): Metal binds of a resource its stage
 never reads (reflected without an index, 0xFFFFFFFF) are no-ops (they crashed
 the AGX driver in setFragmentBuffer/setFragmentTexture); views in a texture's
 sRGB twin format on Metal and Vulkan (8-bit colour render targets are
 mutable-format on Vulkan); Vulkan pipelines take 128 bindings and descriptor
 pools 256 storage buffers

